.TH CPAU\-ELECTRIC "1" "2026\-05\-06" "cpau" "Generated Python Manual"
.SH NAME
cpau\-electric
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B cpau\-electric
[-h] [--version] [-s | -v] [--secrets-file SECRETS_FILE] [-i {billing,monthly,daily,hourly,15min}] [-o OUTPUT_FILE] start_date [end_date]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Download electric meter usage data from the City of Palo Alto Utilities customer portal. Authenticates via the credentials file (default: ~/.cpau/secrets.json) and emits CSV. Supported intervals are billing, monthly, daily, hourly, and 15min; the billing interval emits extra columns describing each billing period. If end_date is omitted it defaults to two days ago, since CPAU's data is usually current to that point. When start_date is later than that default (e.g., during incremental fetches that have caught up to CPAU's trailing edge), an empty CSV is emitted (header only, exit 0) rather than treating the synthesized inverted range as an error.

.TP
\fBstart_date\fR
Start date for data retrieval in YYYY\-MM\-DD format (e.g., 2025\-12\-01)

.TP
\fBend_date\fR
End date for data retrieval in YYYY\-MM\-DD format (default: 2 days ago)

.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-version\fR
show program's version number and exit

.TP
\fB\-s\fR, \fB\-\-silent\fR
supress non\-error logging

.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
log debug\-level processing information

.TP
\fB\-\-secrets\-file\fR \fI\,SECRETS_FILE\/\fR
Path to JSON file with 'userid' and 'password' fields (default: $CPAU_SECRETS_FILE or ~/.cpau/secrets.json)

.TP
\fB\-i\fR \fI\,{billing,monthly,daily,hourly,15min}\/\fR, \fB\-\-interval\fR \fI\,{billing,monthly,daily,hourly,15min}\/\fR
Time interval for data retrieval (default: billing)

.TP
\fB\-o\fR \fI\,OUTPUT_FILE\/\fR, \fB\-\-output\-file\fR \fI\,OUTPUT_FILE\/\fR
Path to output file (default: stdout)

.SH COMMENTS
examples:
  cpau\-electric \-\-interval daily 2025\-01\-01 2025\-01\-31
  cpau\-electric \-\-interval hourly 2025\-01\-01 > electric_hourly.csv
  cpau\-electric \-\-interval billing 2024\-01\-01 2024\-12\-31 \-o billing.csv
  CPAU_SECRETS_FILE=~/work/cpau\-secrets.json cpau\-electric \-i daily 2025\-01\-01

